  "slug": "return-merchandise-proof-of-delivery-form",
  "title": "Return Merchandise Proof of Delivery Form",
  "subtitle": "Authenticate the return merchandise delivery through unit identity, custody events, recipient authority, location, timing, condition, and privacy-conscious proof.",
  "description": "An original, fillable return merchandise proof of delivery form for controlling returned product, return authorization, and disposition unit through proof of delivery identity, observations, evidence, decision, exceptions, escalation, completion, handoff, and final verification without replacing applicable requirements or professional review.",
  "use_case": "Use after a return merchandise delivery or failed attempt when operations must establish what was delivered, to whom, where, when, under which control, and how any evidence gap or dispute was routed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
    {
